  "prefLabel": "Fis 1109.16 Additional Bear License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1109.16 Additional Bear License.\n\n(a) A person shall be permitted to purchase an additional bear license at any time after the purchase of the initial bear license.\n\n(b) Lifetime license holders shall also purchase the additional bear license to take an additional bear.\n\nSource. #13874, eff 2-23-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis1100.html"
